# NINEONELABS Renewal Project

<!-- File-type specific rules are in .claude/rules/ and load on demand -->

## Stack

- **Backend**: PHP 7.4, Custom MVC, MySQL 8.0, Apache (Docker)
- **Frontend**: TypeScript, SCSS, Three.js, Vite, Swiper

## Build & Dev Commands

See @package.json for available npm scripts.

```bash
make up              # Start Docker containers
make down            # Remove containers
make bash            # Access web container
make migrate         # Run DB migrations
make migrate-status  # Check migration status
make install         # Install npm + composer packages
```

## Workflow Rules

- Do NOT run `npm run build` or `npm run watch` — dev server reflects changes on save automatically
- `vendor/` must be included in deployment; exclude `node_modules/`

## Local Access

- Website: [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080)
- phpMyAdmin: [http://localhost:8081](http://localhost:8081)
- DB: localhost:3306 / nineonelabs / user / password
